    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's easy to say that, but it doesn't change the reality. they need a house, they need stability, and all i do is bring more stress. i feel like i'm just dragging them down into this hole with me. if i wasn't here, at least that one weight would be gone. wouldn't it be easier for them if i just wasn't a factor anymore?",
